# Architecture

Stack: TanStack Start, Drizzle, Rocicorp Zero, Better Auth, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui, Bun.

## Folder layout

```
src/
  routes/           # thin pages + API handlers only
  features/<name>/  # vertical slice: ui/, lib/, index.ts
  components/ui/    # shadcn primitives only
  components/       # app shell (Header, ThemeToggle, …)
  server/auth|db/   # Node-only server code
  server/zero/      # isomorphic Zero schema/queries/mutators (client-safe)
  shared/           # env, auth-client, cross-cutting helpers
  lib/utils.ts      # cn() for shadcn
```

## Rules

- Prefer **Vertical Feature Slices**. Colocate feature UI + feature helpers under `features/<name>/`.
- Keep **routes thin**: compose a feature, pass route context as props. No business UI in route files.
- Export the feature public API from `features/<name>/index.ts`.
- App imports use `#/*` (e.g. `#/features/auth`). shadcn uses `@/components/ui/*` and `@/lib/utils`.
- Do **not** put Node-only imports (`pg`, drizzle `db`, fs) in `server/zero/` — client imports from there.
- Do **not** invent FSD layers (`entities`, `widgets`, `pages` as FSD). Stick to this layout.
- Format/lint with Biome (tabs, double quotes). Run `bun run check` before claiming done.

## New feature checklist

1. `src/features/<name>/{ui,lib,index.ts}`
2. Thin route under `src/routes/` that renders the feature
3. Domain tables in `src/server/db/<entity>/`
4. Zero queries/mutators in `src/server/zero/` (extend existing registries; do not keep demo-open authz for real features)
5. UI via shadcn in `components/ui` — add with `bunx shadcn@latest add <component>`
